      "text": "Breaking: Nigeria has once again been ranked among the countries with the lowest quality of life in the world in 2026, according to the latest Numbeo Quality of Life Index. \n\rhttps://t.co/T4R6WHp4Nn\n\nCountries with the Lowest Quality of Life in 2026 (Numbeo Index) Nigeria (last place overall, Quality of Life Index: 0.0)\n Sri Lanka\n Bangladesh\n Venezuela\n Egypt\n Philippines\n Iran\n Indonesia\n Pakistan\n Lebanon\n Kenya\n\nThis crowdsourced ranking evaluates factors like purchasing power, safety, healthcare, cost of living, pollution, traffic, property affordability, and climate. Nigeria scored particularly low on purchasing power and safety while recording high pollution levels, though it performed relatively better on climate. \n\rhttps://t.co/NxDnFiabpV",
