        "text": "While the US burns $2B/day in the Gulf, every adversary on Earth just slammed the accelerator.\n\nSince this morning, every front got worse:\n\n→ TAIWAN: Beijing resumed large-scale air force incursions. Chinese state media warned Taiwan's radars would be \"scrap metal\" in a saturation attack.\n\n→ THE THAAD TELL: The US moved THAAD missile defense FROM South Korea TO the Persian Gulf. Literally stripping Asian deterrence to feed the Iran war.\n\n→ NORTH KOREA: Kim fired 12 nuclear-capable missiles this month — while the shield protecting Seoul was being packed onto cargo planes.\n\n→ RUSSIA: Spring offensive launched against Ukraine's Fortress Belt. 1,720 casualties in a single day — record for 2026. Moscow sees the window.\n\n→ CHINA TRADE: Two formal trade-barrier investigations launched March 27. Legal cover for rare-earth bans, suspended Treasury purchases, or tariffs when it hurts most.\n\n→ CUBA: Trump said \"Cuba's next\" yesterday. Havana's oil lifeline from Venezuela already severed post-Maduro.\n\nHot war in the Gulf. Cold war reigniting across every theater. THAAD moving east to west. One Treasury trying to fund all of it.\n\nSunday night futures are going to be spicy.\n\nWhere front escalates first?👇",
